message: "If you use this software or its datasets, please cite it as below."
title: "Overthink Conjecture Engine"
abstract: >-
  A falsification-first discovery loop for combinatorial game theory:
  compute exact game data, mine it for conjectures with classical miners and an
  AI proposer, test every conjecture on at least 10x more data, formalize
  survivors in Lean 4, and record everything (including refutations) in an open
  conjecture registry.
